Cell["\<\
System\[CloseCurlyQuote]s default Kind is \[OpenCurlyQuote]Latin\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]. We define another Kind \[OpenCurlyQuote]Greek\
\[CloseCurlyQuote] to use tensors with Greek index characters:\
\>", "Text",
